  "label": "Hateful Meme Audience",
  "description": "The intended audience is individuals who hold prejudiced views toward President Obama and the transgender community, particularly those who support or are influenced by misinformation that frames transgender identity as a mental illness. The meme targets those who may be politically opposed to Obama’s progressive policies, especially those related to LGBTQ+ rights, and seeks to incite hostility by using false equivalences and stigmatizing language. The audience is likely to be drawn to the meme’s hateful rhetoric and may be motivated by anti-LGBTQ+ discrimination, ableism (specifically mental illness stigma), and political animosity toward Obama.",
